    {"type":"text","id":"b1_docker_matrix_text","x":880,"y":1038,"width":600,"height":145,"text":"Docker image matrix\n\nDockerfile                 full CUDA + vLLM + NIXL       entry: vllm serve\nDockerfile.lightweight     released wheel + vLLM         no NIXL / no PD\nDockerfile.standalone      full LMCache, no vLLM          CMD /bin/bash → lmcache server\nDockerfile.rocm            source HIP + vLLM-ROCm        no flashinfer / NIXL\nDockerfile.rocm-lightweight clone + HIP against base torch no NIXL / PD\n\nPublished: lmcache/vllm-openai · lmcache/standalone · ROCm variants","originalText":"Docker image matrix\n\nDockerfile                 full CUDA + vLLM + NIXL       entry: vllm serve\nDockerfile.lightweight     released wheel + vLLM         no NIXL / no PD\nDockerfile.standalone      full LMCache, no vLLM          CMD /bin/bash → lmcache server\nDockerfile.rocm            source HIP + vLLM-ROCm        no flashinfer / NIXL\nDockerfile.rocm-lightweight clone + HIP against base torch no NIXL / PD\n\nPublished: lmcache/vllm-openai · lmcache/standalone · ROCm variants","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1800017,"version":1,"versionNonce":1800018,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
